        "18": {
            "name": "input18",
            "order": "31",
            "qid": "18",
            "text": "<p>We also offer clay paw prints for those owners who elect cremation. These are more three-dimensional if you prefer this way. Clay paw prints are $80.25 each. </p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://www.jotform.com/uploads/vaydreception/form_files/IMG_2561.6488891b1f0968.86405894.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" />     <img src=\"https://www.jotform.com/uploads/vaydreception/form_files/IMG_2562.6488893caf2b73.59961294.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" /></p>",
            "type": "control_text"
        },
        "19": {
            "name": "input19",
            "order": "30",
            "qid": "19",
            "text": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Paw prints: </strong></span></p>\r\n<p>Paw prints can be a nice, lasting reminder of your beloved pet. We offer ink paw prints (pictured below) at no charge. These can be hung in a frame, or tucked away somewhere special. </p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://www.jotform.com/uploads/vaydreception/form_files/IMG_8791.64935eeb559d49.83360635.jpg\" alt width=\"300\" /></p>",
            "type": "control_text"
        },
