        "28": {
            "name": "input28",
            "order": "37",
            "qid": "28",
            "text": "<p>By signing below, I, {ClientName}, hereby state that I am the legal owner or legally authorized representative of the legal owner of {petname} and am authorized to make all medical decisions regarding {petname}. I have declined any further care for {petname} and am hereby authorizing Vet At Your Door, PC to euthanize {petname}.</p>\r\n<p>I agree to have Vet At Your Door, PC choose a euthanasia protocol at their sole and exclusive discretion and have had all my questions and concerns regarding this process answered prior to signing this consent. I attest that {petname} has not been exposed to rabies, has not bitten anyone, and has not displayed any signs of unusual attitude or aggression in the last 15 days.</p>\r\n<p>My aftercare preference is as follows: {AftercarePreference}. </p>\r\n<p>It is my desire to provide for {petname} decent and humane after-death care, complying with all legal requirements of the area. If I choose or have chosen cremation for {petname}, I authorize Vet At Your Door, PC to take charge of my pet's remains in accordance with practice policy, releasing the staff from any and all liability for performing said after-death care.</p>\r\n<p> </p>",
            "type": "control_text"
        },
        "30": {
            "name": "input30",
            "order": "20",
            "qid": "30",
            "text": "<p>🚩 <strong>NOTE: If you decide to bury {petname} at home, it is important to provide a proper, safe burial.</strong>  Please be sure to <a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/dacf/php/nutrient_management/documents/Brochure-HomeownerCarcassBurialGuidelines.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">look at these guidelines</a> to be sure that you keep wildlife, you, and your family safe. 🚩</p>",
            "type": "control_text"
        },
