        "36": {
            "name": "input36",
            "order": "34",
            "qid": "36",
            "text": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Memorial Items: </strong></span></p>\r\n<p>We also wanted to invite you to look at <a href=\"https://www.vetatyourdoor.com/online-pharmacy/-c138284806\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">our selection of memorial items on our online store</a> that can help memorialize your pet. From different urns (indoor and <a href=\"https://www.vetatyourdoor.com/online-pharmacy/Outdoor-Urns-c138338804\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">outdoor</a>), <a href=\"https://www.vetatyourdoor.com/online-pharmacy/Cemetery-Stones-c138344059\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">grave stones</a>, to <a href=\"https://www.vetatyourdoor.com/online-pharmacy/Jewelry-c138344332\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">jewelry</a>, there are many personalized options that may offer something special for you. If you see something you like, please select and pay for it through our online store to ensure timely production. </p>",
            "type": "control_text"
        },
