        "45": {
            "name": "input45",
            "order": "12",
            "qid": "45",
            "text": "<p>To keep everyone safe, we have established the following covid-19 protocols: </p>\r\n<p>1. If you or someone in your household is awaiting a covid test or has tested positive for covid in the last 10 days, <strong>please reschedule your appointment.</strong> </p>\r\n<p>2. <strong>Wear a mask </strong>if you are <a href=\"https://www.cdc.gov/coronavirus/2019-ncov/symptoms-testing/symptoms.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">displaying any signs of illness </a>(runny nose, cough, fever, etc.), even if you have tested negative for COVID.</p>\r\n<p>3.  <strong>Masks are now optional</strong> if you are feeling healthy. Your VAYD veterinarian may or may not be wearing a mask. If you prefer us to wear a mask, please let us know - we are happy to oblige. </p>",
            "type": "control_text"
        },
        "46": {
            "name": "input46",
            "order": "13",
            "qid": "46",
            "text": "<p>To keep everyone safe, we have established the following covid-19 protocols: </p>\r\n<p>1. If you or someone in your household is awaiting a covid test or has tested positive for covid in the last 10 days, OR are <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">currently</span> ill, <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">even if you have tested negative for covid-19</span>, <strong>please reschedule your appointment</strong>. </p>\r\n<p>2. If you or anyone in your household has been ill in the last two weeks but are currently displaying no symptoms, please wear a mask. </p>\r\n<p>3. Masks are optional if you are feeling healthy and have had no illness in the household in the last 14 days. Dr. Petersen will still be wearing a mask.   </p>",
            "type": "control_text"
        },
